### Install the "REST Client" VS Code extension, then click "Send Request" above each block.
@base = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Create users
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Asha", "email": "asha@vit.ac.in"}

### 2. View available seats
GET {{base}}/seats?status=AVAILABLE

### 3. Reserve seat 7 for user 1 (idempotent: resend with same key -> same booking)
POST {{base}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-1

{"user_id": 1, "seat_id": 7}

### 4. Reservation status (countdown in seconds_left)
GET {{base}}/bookings/1

### 5. Pay: mode = success | fail | delayed
POST {{base}}/bookings/1/pay
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pay-key-1

{"mode": "success"}

### 6. Booking history
GET {{base}}/users/1/bookings

### 7. Cancel (refunds if paid; seat goes to next waitlisted user, else back to pool)
POST {{base}}/bookings/1/cancel

### 8. Waitlist (only when sold out)
POST {{base}}/waitlist
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": 2}

###
GET {{base}}/waitlist/1

###
GET {{base}}/stats
